                "location": "engine/review/fsstore/fsstore.go:114-118",
                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "The comment on the new Store fields says they are used 'instead of lockWait and syscall.Flock', but the zero-value default is the package constant lockWait defined only in lock_unix.go (unix builds). The field and constant share the same name, and on non-unix builds the fields are unused, which makes the field/constant relationship and platform scope easy to misread.",
